## Habitat/Society

Luthax resents Lady Merendil's leadership role and can prove reluctant to cooperate with her.

## Ecology

Because Luthax requires magic to cast spells, he is vigilant about finding magic to absorb. At approximately 741 years of age, he can store 741 levels. He must maintain about half this amount, 375 levels, to cast his spells.

For each level Luthax expends, he can:
1. Detect magic up to 74 miles away for one day; or
1. For one turn, cause tiny fissures to open anywhere he steps that emit a steady flow of sulfurous gases that, over a period of 24 hours, kills all plantlife within 74 yards; or
1. Regenerate 7 hit points; or 
1. Cause a 74 yard-long earthquake, toppling any tree or structure within 74 feet; or
1. Create a 70' flame barrier 7 yards long from any fissure within 70 feet that inflicts 7dS points of fire damage to any creature touched. (A successful saving throw vs. spell reduces damage by half.) By expending more levels, he can increase the length, height, or damage of the barrier.

